  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that, Molecular weight of compound or molecules $=2 \\times \\mathrm{V}$. $\\mathrm{D}$\nVapour density (V. D.) of ozone molecules\n$=\\frac{\\mathrm{M} . \\text { wt. of } \\mathrm{O}_{3}}{2}=\\frac{48}{2}=24$\nHence, $\\mathrm{V} . \\mathrm{D}$. of $\\mathrm{O}_{3}$ is 24",
